  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic empowerment of women&apos; farmers in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite recent progress, Albanian women still have limited access to resources and opportunities.  The project goal is that: Women in rural areas in Central Albania to improve their socio-economic situation by engaging in economic activities. The project will support 6 women farmers to construct and operate greenhouses aiming to improve their economic situation as well as will train 20 women farmers in food processing to improve knowledge and skills on preservation, hygiene and quality standard.</narrative>
  </description>
